E. Adversarial Probate Proceeding
Administrative Order
2019-4.5
directs that any adversary Probate proceeding requiring more than ½ day will be transferred to the Civil Division for trial only. The Court defines ½ day as three hours in length or more.
Matters ½ day (3 hours) or less
: Contact the Judicial Assistant for available dates via email copying the other side.
Matters more than ½ day
